{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c7c3","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c4fd-996a-7423-ba27-e5daf29de5a2"},"sequence":572,"recorded_at":1780531400001139,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"e01e1bc2-95c9-4151-a1a6-6ebbbbe18d95","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"e01e1bc2-95c9-4151-a1a6-6ebbbbe18d95","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"e01e1bc2-95c9-4151-a1a6-6ebbbbe18d95"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c50e-48f6-70a1-8343-09d80dcb9222"},"task_id":"01a0c50e-48f6-70a1-8343-09d80dcb9222","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c50e-48f6-70a1-8343-09d80dcb9222","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-9-1\",\n  \"command\": \"grep -n \\\"tmuxserver\\\\|tmux\\\" README.md | head -20; echo \\\"===\\\"; grep -n \\\"effectiveUID\\\" internal/tmuxserver/*_test.go | head; echo \\\"===\\\"; grep -n \\\"TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesForeignOwnership\\\" -A 40 internal/tmuxserver/runtime_test.go | head -60\",\n  \"description\": \"Check README, seam usage, ownership test\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"64:  -> M3 daily-driver tmux\\n256:`terminal.backend` accepts exactly `tmux|conpty` before translation.\\n1042:string check. Section 4.B also reserves the `ax.` namespace and names `ax.tmux`\\n2329:## Private tmux server management (`tmuxserver` leaf)\\n2331:[`internal/tmuxserver`](internal/tmuxserver) creates owner-only runtime\\n2332:directories and manages dedicated `tmux -S` servers with no ambient or\\n2334:The dedicated socket is `<runtime>/tmux/ax.sock` under the Runtime IPC\\n2362:runs through injected dependencies, so the suite passes with no tmux\\n2368:go test ./internal/tmuxserver -count=1\\n2369:go test ./internal/tmuxserver -cover -count=1\\n2376:PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/tmuxserver/mutant_harness.py\\n2387:[the task evidence map](internal/tmuxserver/TRACEABILITY.md).\\n2799: